  "description": "Open-ended Q&A against the knowledge base. Locates candidate pages with one call to the deterministic retrieval script (.knowlery/bin/query.mjs), then reads the promising ones with Obsidian CLI and synthesizes an evidence-based answer with citations. Use when the user asks questions about vault content like \"what is X\", \"why did we decide Y\", \"explain Z\", \"what do my notes say about\", \"summarize what I know about\", or any question that should be answered from accumulated knowledge rather than general training data.",
